  "description": "Comer Group Ireland are proud to present this stunning 2 bedroom property at Market Square, Kilcullen.\n\nBest in class air to water heating system - BER A3\n\n*PLEASE REFER TO VIDEO OF APARTMENT IN MEDIA SECTION OF THIS AD\n\nThis luxurious apartment guarantees quality living with stylish interior living arrangements providing modern, high-end specifications in every detail. The architectural design of the apartment ensures a vast amount of natural light fills the perfectly appointed living areas, where use of space is maximised to create a luxurious, modern open plan feel.\n\nThe apartment features spacious bedrooms, modern bathroom, large kitchen and a separate utility room with washing machine and tumble dryer. The apartment is fitted out to the highest standard and comes fully furnished to include high-end appliances and furniture including: sofa, coffee table, TV stand, dining table & chairs, fridge/freezer, washer machine and separate tumble dryer, oven, hob, microwave, dishwasher, beds & mattresses, bed side cabinets, fitted wardrobes. \n\nThe apartment is served by best-in-class air to water units (a natural, renewable source of energy for heating and hot water). All broadband and TV providers are available (at an additional cost to the tenant). Communal bin disposal and one car park space is included in the monthly rent.\n\nPlease refer to video of apartment in media section of ad.\n\n* No pets allowed\n\n** Subletting not allowed \n\n*** Apartment available for immediate letting only.\n\n***** Viewing by appointment only - EMAIL ONLY to make an appointment. NO PHONE CALLS PLEASE *****",
